                blog17Feat6: "Standardized Save QR button title across all supported application languages.",
                blog17Feat7: "Set the Custom tab in QR Code to be turned off by default in General settings.",
                blog17Feat8: "Removed the colored selection outline from export format cards for a cleaner visual design.",
                blog17Feat9: "Integrated official Noto Sans Arabic font family across five weights directly into the app resources for offline use.",
                blog17Feat10: "Automated Arabic typography switching across all Material Design text styles whenever the Arabic language is active.",
                blog17Feat11: "Updated the onboarding flow typography to properly adapt to Noto Sans Arabic.",
