                blog14Desc: "Modern, privacy-first offline P2P file & media sharing app for Android. Share photos, 4K videos, and large files at high speed via Wi-Fi Direct, Local Hotspot, Bluetooth, and QR code pairing, 100% offline with zero cloud servers.",
                blog14Author: "Hamza Bellouch",
                authorRole14: "CEO & Founder of tknoglobal",
                blog14Intro: "Modern, privacy-first offline P2P file & media sharing app for Android. Share photos, 4K videos, and large files at high speed via Wi-Fi Direct, Local Hotspot, Bluetooth, and QR code pairing, 100% offline with zero cloud servers.",
                blog14Subhead1: "Zero Cloud, Zero Tracking, Pure High-Speed P2P",
                blog14Body1: "Miora is engineered from the ground up for privacy-conscious users and heavy media sharers. By establishing direct high-bandwidth local channels using Wi-Fi Direct and temporary Local Hotspots, Miora bypasses all cellular data caps, cloud middlemen, and external internet throttling.",
