                blog15Meta: "October 14, 2026 · Ren Browser · New version · Release notes",
                blog15Title: "Ren Browser version 0.0.3-beta",
                blog15Desc: "Announcing Ren Browser v0.0.3-beta! In-app Auto Update page with GitHub release downloads, dedicated native ren-tor module with 100% bootstrap fix, Tor & Cloudflare WARP mutual exclusion, standalone Credits page, and in-app problem reporting.",
                blog15Author: "Hamza Bellouch",
                authorRole15: "CEO & Founder of tknoglobal",
                blog15Intro: "We are thrilled to announce the release of Ren Browser v0.0.3-beta! This update introduces an in-app Auto Update engine with channel selection, our dedicated native ren-tor module with embedded binaries eliminating Tor bootstrap stalls, mutual exclusion between Tor and Cloudflare WARP, and refined UI controls throughout.",
                blog15Subhead1: "Dedicated ren-tor Module & Tor Bootstrap Fixes",
                blog15Body1: "In this release, we replaced kmp-tor with our dedicated, native-optimized ren-tor module containing embedded binaries. This resolves previous connection stalls and guarantees 100% bootstrap completion. Furthermore, a mutual exclusion system now coordinates Tor routing and Cloudflare WARP, automatically dimming and locking one mode when the other is active to prevent packet collisions and protocol conflicts.",
                blog15Subhead2: "Changes — October 14, 2026",
                blog15Subhead3: "Downloads & Release Assets",
                blog15Body2: "Ren Browser v0.0.3-beta is available now on GitHub Releases. Test the latest release on Android, explore the Auto Update utility, and report any feedback or issues on GitHub.",
