                blog11Meta: "August 6, 2026 · Agent Skills · Major Release · Version 2.0.0",
                blog11Title: "Agent Skills v2.0.0",
                blog11Desc: "Major release shipping 20 new expert domain categories — Multi-Cloud, MLOps, Computer Vision, Cloud Native, Cybersecurity, Quantum AI, Spatial Computing, and ROS 2 Robotics — for Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Cursor, and Codex.",
                blog11Author: "Hamza Bellouch",
                authorRole11: "CEO & Founder of tknoglobal",
                blog11Intro: "Agent Skills v2.0.0 is here — a landmark major release introducing 20 brand-new expert domain categories that equip AI Coding Assistants (Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Codex) with instant, production-grade knowledge across cloud infrastructure, cybersecurity, machine learning, robotics, and beyond.",
                blog11Subhead1: "20 New Expert Domain Categories",
                blog11Body1: "This release dramatically expands the capability surface of Agent Skills, spanning the most in-demand engineering disciplines. Each new category ships with production-ready skill definitions, structured instructions, and actionable patterns your AI coding assistant can apply immediately.",
                blog11Subhead2: "Changes — August 6, 2026",
                blog11Feat1: "Multi-Cloud Infrastructure: AWS CDK and Azure Bicep skills for infrastructure-as-code provisioning at scale.",
                blog11Feat2: "MLOps & Speech AI: MLflow experiment tracking, model drift detection, and Whisper STT integration skills.",
