                blog11Feat7: "Upgraded the overall application version to v2.0.0 with improved skill metadata and execution harness.",
                blog11Subhead3: "Supercharge Your AI Coding Assistant",
                blog11Body2: "Whether you are using Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Cursor, or Codex, Agent Skills v2.0.0 gives your assistant instant expert-level knowledge across 20+ engineering domains. Clone the repository, drop skills into your agent configuration, and unlock production-grade capabilities in seconds.",
